collections.special_event_steps.ayako_re:
On the left stood a tall figure with eyes as cold and keen as a blade, her white coat billowing without a breeze beneath bold lettering that read: 'Absolute-Zero Lone-Wolf Queen of the Scalpel';
on the right stood a petite, slender figure poised straight as a javelin, an unmistakable cowlick springing atop her head and one hand resting on the hilt of a phantom sword at her hip, crowned with bold lettering that read: 'Unyielding Chivalric Disciplinary Deputy Chief.'
And dead center where their gazes collided, Ayako had inked a crackling explosion of clashing black lightning screentone with her thickest G-pen!
